  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cartagena Expansion of Sewerage System</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Expansin de Sistema de Alcantarrillado de Cartagena</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EXPANSION OF SEWERAGE SYSTEM THROUGH THE ENLARGEMENT AND REHABILITATION OF THE NETWORK IN SOME AREAS AND CONSTRUCTION OF NEW FACILITIES IN OTHER AREAS THAT CURRENTLY HAVE NO SERVICE. ALSO, THE PROJECT WILL ELIMINATE SUPERFICIAL WASTEWATER DISCHARGE POINTS IN THE BAY OF CARTAGENA. ALL WASTEWATER FROM NEIGHBORHOODS THAT DISCHARGE TO THE BAY WILL BE REDIRECTED TO THE BAY OUTFALL CURRENTLY IN OPERATION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
